  "note": "Curated terms corpus for opportunity relevance, matched by /extract-entities (Flashtext + fuzzy, no LLM). Version-controlled like the SPARTA/aerospace corpora. Prefer multi-word specific aliases over short tokens to avoid fuzzy false positives (e.g. bare 'agent'/'agentic' fuzzy-matches 'Agency'). Tune via the adversarial eval, not intuition. Category values are namespaced (never bare English words): extract-entities indexes `category` as a matchable term, so 'federal'/'security'/'verification' produced false positives on unrelated text (2026-08-13).",
